@startuml
!include includes/report-style.iuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
hide footbox

actor "Admin UI" as Admin
participant "Go API" as API
database "PostgreSQL users row" as DB
actor "Concurrent login" as Login

Admin -> API : Account-control mutation
API -> DB : BEGIN; SELECT users FOR UPDATE
API -> API : Last-admin and transition checks
API -> DB : Update account and revoke sessions
Login -> API : Login with same email
API -> DB : Wait for same users row lock
DB -> API : Commit mutation and release lock
API -> DB : Login rereads current account state
API -> Login : Create session or reject
API -> Admin : Return audited result
@enduml
